      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW LIBBY (3) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 34.87 beating Twitching. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Well placed and can measure up. PAID IN GLORY (4) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fifth and beaten 4.5 lengths (35.53) at this track. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Should be about the money. JIMMY LEGS (1) has mixed form recently, finishing eighth (35.68) in a Restricted WIN at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. TRUE HORNET (2) is right in the mix.",
